
Healthy vs Unhealthy Plant Leaf Detection (CNN)
Dataset: PlantVillage (54,303 leaf photos, 38 classes), downloaded automatically. We turn the 38 classes into 2: 1 = healthy, 0 = unhealthy.

In Colab: Runtime > Change runtime type > T4 GPU makes training faster. Then Runtime > Run all.

